  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-41123-PROJECT-240050</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41123" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering low carbon and positive energy industrial spaces to accelerate the just energy transition in South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the low carbon transformation of South Africa#s Industrial Sector by promoting optimization of energy co nsumption and the enhanced embedded generation of distributed renewable energy in Industrial Spaces.  The project will achieve this through: - Facilitating the creation of an enabling environment through conducting policy analysis, identifying gaps and proposing policy rec ommendations, carrying out assessments, developing guidelines, increasing capacity and forging partnerships.  -Showcasing the potential for renewable energy generation and energy management systems to trigger investments into these Industrial Spaces.  The project will support the development of an investment ready pipeline of projects and implement pilot projects to showcase sustainable business models and the benefits of the Low Carbon Positive Energy industrial Spaces approach.</narrative>
  </description>
